七味，再到柴魚醋，\n彷彿在一碗湯裡發現無限可能，\n必須很肉麻的說「我願意！」，\n再來個十次，感受不同順序組合。\n整體而言，是超級值得推薦的店家。",null,[0,36]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3TW1KdVZtWlBSR3hFVTFoc2RGbHJOV3hhVjNSb1QxZDRiMDV0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1348,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wMmJuVmZPRGxEU1hsdFlrNWxaV3RoT1d4b05tYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbb7f26a3baba013e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmp2bnVfODlDSXltYk5lZWthOWxoNmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wMmJuVmZPRGxEU1hsdFlrNWxaV3RoT1d4b05tYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wMmJuVmZPRGxEU1hsdFlrNWxaV3RoT1d4b05tYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wMmJuVmZPRGxEU1hsdFlrNWxaV3RoT1d4b05tYxILMGR0V1JUWlNFdkoaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tcDJiblZmT0RsRFNYbHRZazVsWld0aE9XeG9ObWMSCzBkdFdSVFpTRXZKIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARPgG6uqMmf7sqCzBkdFdSVFpTRXZK\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\